&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unique candidate criteria&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You might be a particularly great fit for this workstream if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong software engineering skills with experience building complex ML systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can balance research exploration with engineering rigor and operational reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy collaborating across research and engineering disciplines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable working with large-scale distributed systems and high-performance computing (e.g. in trading)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with training, fine-tuning, or evaluating large language models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are adept at analyzing and debugging model training processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may be a good fit if you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are motivated by making sure AI is safe and beneficial for society as a whole&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are excited to transition into empirical AI research and would be interested in a full-time role at Anthropic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a strong technical background in computer science, mathematics, or physics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in fast-paced, collaborative environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can implement ideas quickly and communicate clearly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidates must be&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in Python programming&lt;/li&gt;
