&lt;li&gt;Experience with the tax aspects of data center or infrastructure buildouts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Pillar Two/global minimum tax rules and digital services taxes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Indian direct tax matters, including permanent establishment and withholding tax issues&lt;/li&gt;
