&lt;li&gt;Document and share best practices for LLM prompting, evaluation, agentic workflows, and architecture design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create demo environments and technical proof-of-concepts that showcase Claude&#39;s capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct technical discovery calls to understand customer requirements and development workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help customers design scalable architectures and develop evaluation frameworks for their AI implementations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical troubleshooting and implementation support during customer evaluations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside Solutions Architects and Product Engineers on complex technical requirements in sales cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Forward Deployed Engineers on post-deployment optimization and expansion opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Synthesize technical feedback from customer interactions to inform product roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rotate through different Applied AI segments over the 6-month program, gaining exposure to various customer profiles and use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
