&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience building or running evaluations, benchmarks, or test suites for software or ML systems, including delivering results on short, fixed timelines&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on cybersecurity experience (e.g., CTF participation, vulnerability research, exploit development, or security research)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proficiency in Python&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong ability to communicate evaluation results with multiple cross-functional stakeholders or potential policy stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
