&lt;p&gt;Experience with AI/ML evaluation frameworks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with coordinated vulnerability disclosure practices&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
