&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;21:1-21:136;2278-2413&quot;&gt;Experience writing production-quality SQL and Python (or a similar language) to build pipelines, dashboards, and models independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;22:1-22:141;2414-2554&quot;&gt;Experience serving as the primary data or analytics voice in a space where the questions weren&#39;t yet well-defined, and helping define them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;23:1-23:190;2555-2744&quot;&gt;A track record of holding conclusions loosely — favoring instrumentation and evidence-gathering over defending a prior position, and revising views in public when the evidence warrants it&lt;/li&gt;
