&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience with contracting systems, billing platforms, and ERP systems (e.g., Salesforce, Stripe, NetSuite, Oracle, Workday Financials, Zuora)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record leading large-scale strategic and automation initiatives end-to-end, from business case through implementation and adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and developing operations teams&lt;/li&gt;
