&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with product, marketing, and data science teams to identify and prioritize growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take an inclusive, equitable approach to hiring and coaching technical talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the development of scalable systems for experimentation, personalization, and optimization&lt;/li&gt;
