&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience as an product minded engineering manager, with at least 2 years leading growth engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience applying machine learning and AI technologies to growth challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success implementing product-led growth strategies and viral loops at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in modern web development stacks and experimentation frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
