&lt;li&gt;A deep understanding of federal civilian agency missions, challenges, and technology needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated the ability to balance strategic leadership with hands-on sales execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating complex federal procurement processes and compliance requirements&lt;/li&gt;
