&lt;li&gt;Originate and shape exceptional executive communications that span a wide array of written and rhetorical formats and platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with External Communications colleagues and other subject matter experts to drive consequential communications moments that serve strategic goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support senior leaders in developing their areas of communications focus and in their preparation for major communications moments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance a collaborative ethic with a strategic point of view&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may be a good fit if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 8+ years of high level executive communications experience, ideally at a high-tempo, industry-shaping organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are an exceptional writer and communicator — both on the page, and in high-stakes, fast-moving environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are high agency and low ego&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate comfort and experience in supporting senior leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a point of view on how forces of change are reshaping traditional communications disciplines, including executive communications&lt;/li&gt;
