&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience in escalation management, trust &amp;amp; safety operations, customer support, or a related front-line operations role—ideally at a consumer or developer platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct, hands-on experience running incidents or escalations: you&#39;ve been the person investigating the issue, coordinating R&amp;amp;R with XFN partners, and writing executive comms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharp written communication—you can brief a senior leader in three sentences and document an incident so the next responder can pick it up cold&lt;/li&gt;
