&lt;li&gt;Prepare and deliver clear, concise, and insightful financial reports, analyses, and forecasts, highlighting key trends, risks, and opportunities to facilitate informed decision-making to stakeholders and executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with other members of strategic finance, FP&amp;amp;A, and accounting counterparts, helping to align go-to-market with broader financial strategies and considerations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
