&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;3:1-3:18;34-51&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;5:1-5:422;53-474&quot;&gt;Anthropic is seeking a Global Technology Partner Lead to build and scale our strategic partnerships with leading technology platforms. In this role, you&#39;ll own multi-dimensional relationships spanning product integrations, co-selling, channel enablement, and joint go-to-market execution — turning key partnerships into major revenue drivers for Anthropic while helping partners capture real value from the AI landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;7:1-7:328;476-803&quot;&gt;This is a foundational role: you&#39;ll build the Global Technology Partnerships function from the ground up, defining team strategy and establishing the operating model as the group scales. You&#39;ll operate at the executive level with partner leadership while also driving tactical execution across a portfolio of priority accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;9:1-9:24;805-828&quot;&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;11:1-20:102;830-2053&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;11:1-11:126;830-955&quot;&gt;Build the Global Technology Partnerships function, including team development, operating model, goals, and overall strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;12:1-12:119;956-1074&quot;&gt;Own the joint go-to-market relationship and joint business plan with a portfolio of named global technology partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;13:1-13:157;1075-1231&quot;&gt;Define the joint value proposition for each partner in collaboration with account teams, including which products, use cases, and industries to prioritize&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;14:1-14:133;1232-1364&quot;&gt;Build and maintain executive relationships within partner leadership teams, identifying their largest transformation opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;15:1-15:99;1365-1463&quot;&gt;Develop competitive positioning and enablement programs across partner sales and technical teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;16:1-16:125;1464-1588&quot;&gt;Create sales tools, training curricula, and certification programs that equip partner teams to effectively position Claude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;17:1-17:77;1589-1665&quot;&gt;Partner with marketing on co-marketing, events, and joint customer stories&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;18:1-18:153;1666-1818&quot;&gt;Partner with technical teams to build production-grade, Claude-powered solutions, including reference architectures and industry-specific accelerators&lt;/li&gt;
