&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time inside a startup, not just selling to them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building with LLMs, even on side projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A history of describing wins by what the customer built rather than the size of the deal&lt;/li&gt;
