&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A proactive, solutions-oriented approach to identifying, recommending, and implementing process improvements within the legal department&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5+ years of experience in legal operations, business/operations management, or a paralegal role in an in-house legal department&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2+ years of experience at a high-growth technology company, with exposure to the legal challenges and opportunities presented by emerging technologies&lt;/p&gt;
