&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of relevant legal experience, including substantial experience in life sciences transactional work — contract research, strategic collaborations, and licensing and commercialization deals — with the ability to operate independently and hit the ground running&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI/ML companies or products deployed into regulated scientific and clinical settings, particularly for drug discovery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with biosecurity, dual-use research, or export control considerations in the life sciences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leveraging AI to optimize their work, with a desire to work in a fast-paced, innovative environment&lt;/li&gt;
