&lt;p&gt;Anthropic&#39;s Investor Relations team manages our relationships with shareholders, prospective investors, and the broader financial community, and helps educate investors on Anthropic&#39;s mission, strategy, and financial performance. As the Operations Lead for the team, you&#39;ll own the administrative and operational backbone that keeps IR running smoothly, from coordinating investor meetings and preparing the team for them to managing the vendors and logistics behind high-profile events and visits.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work directly with the Head of Investor Relations and the IR team, and cross-functionally with Finance leadership, Finance &amp;amp; Strategy, Capital Markets, Accounting, Corporate Legal, Communications, and Workplace, to make sure every investor touchpoint reflects well on Anthropic. Because the function is still being built, you will often be creating the process rather than following one. This role suits someone who is highly proactive, thrives on structure, anticipates needs before they arise, and enjoys being the person who makes complex logistics look effortless.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Schedule and coordinate investor calls, meetings, and briefings, managing calendars across multiple stakeholders and time zones, and helping the team prioritize when investor demand exceeds our capacity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with internal teams and on-site staff to plan and execute investor events, visits, and other in-person engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare the team and executives for investor conversations and capturing follow-ups afterward&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own vendor relationships for IR-related services, from sourcing through ongoing management of scope, budget, and performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help the team set agendas and priorities, tracking deliverables and following up to ensure commitments are met on time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and organize IR records, the investor contact database and interaction history, and shared materials so information stays easy to find and current, and help select and run the tools the team uses to track shareholder engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a primary point of contact for internal stakeholders and external partners on logistical and administrative questions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and document the recurring processes a growing IR function needs, from meeting request intake through post-meeting follow-up, and keep improving how the team operates day to day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Corporate Legal and Communications on the handling and review of investor-facing materials, so information moves through the right checks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support ad hoc projects as investor relations priorities evolve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
