&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5 +&amp;nbsp; years of experience in research, people analytics, or related quantitative fields with demonstrated research methodology expertise&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Background in recruiting analytics specifically (not just general analytics)&lt;/p&gt;
