&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong visual and interaction craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or working on a design system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with design tokens, theming and accessibility standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in whichever tool gets an idea across fastest, from Figma to code.&lt;/li&gt;
