&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A large and growing share of Claude usage reaches customers through our cloud partners — Amazon Bedrock, Google Cloud&#39;s Agent Platform, and Microsoft Foundry. These surfaces require bespoke solutions so our approaches have to be designed for third-party distribution from the start. In this role you will own how Anthropic&#39;s model safeguards, fraud defenses, and compliance posture show up on every cloud.&lt;/p&gt;
