&lt;li&gt;Partner with sales and partnerships to support enterprise evaluations where data-handling and safety requirements are decisive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with marketing and partner teams on how we position our safeguards externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
