&lt;h3&gt;You may be a good fit if you have:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to make technical tradeoff decisions; ideally with experience working across policy experts, AI/ML research engineers and software engineering teams to design and build state of the art safety systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
