&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a product marketer to join the Claude Platform Product Marketing team. You&#39;ll drive go-to-market for launches across the platform, from new API features and developer tools to the capabilities that ship with new models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll partner with Product to bring new capabilities to market, write the positioning and messaging that explain what each one does and who it&#39;s for, and give Sales the narratives and materials they need to win technical deals. If you&#39;ve run launches for developer platforms, API products, or technical infrastructure and want to launch new capabilities every week, this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
