&lt;li&gt;Drive product launches that generate market momentum, from flagship releases to incremental feature updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement developer marketing campaigns to drive API adoption and platform usage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support sales enablement initiatives that equip our teams to win: battlecards, pitch materials, customer stories, and objection handling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product to shape roadmap priorities based on competitive intel, customer research, and field feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Developer Relations, Comms, Creative, Marketing, and Sales to effectively bring new products to market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
