&lt;p&gt;Anthropic has an ambitious mission with high stakes and tight timelines. In some cases, the talent we need to achieve our vision can&#39;t be accessed through traditional recruiting alone. That&#39;s where M&amp;amp;A comes in, and this role is what keeps it running smoothly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Recruiting M&amp;amp;A Program Specialist&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Talent team and coordinate the interview experience behind our acquisition hiring. You&#39;ll be a key point of contact across Corporate Development, Legal, People, and the technical organization, coordinating interviews and guiding candidates and incoming employees from first conversation through to their start date. Your work will be challenging and unique, and it directly supports Anthropic&#39;s efforts to remain on the frontier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Role required to work out of the Anthropic San Francisco Office - Relocation available.&lt;/p&gt;
