&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own full-cycle recruiting across G&amp;amp;A functions, adapting candidate profiles, comp benchmarks, and assessment criteria to each segment and level&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Context-switch between high-volume hiring and strategic, senior searches while maintaining consistent quality and candidate experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage a high req load across multiple hiring managers without becoming a bottleneck — using data and systems to prioritize, surface issues early, and keep pipelines healthy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build repeatable, scalable processes, and leverage AI and automation to increase throughput across your portfolio&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Integrate into existing hiring rhythms while bringing recruiting expertise — calibration, market insight, and process improvement — and pushing back constructively when patterns aren&#39;t working&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own outcomes across a diverse portfolio, holding yourself accountable for hiring results rather than activity&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Protect Anthropic&#39;s culture by deeply understanding our mission and screening for alignment alongside capability&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
