&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have demonstrated success recruiting across G&amp;amp;A role types and segments (e.g., Finance, Legal, People, Operations) and understand how profiles, comp, and assessment criteria differ across levels&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
