&lt;p&gt;The Computer Use team focuses on teaching Claude to see, use, and understand computer interfaces. As a Research Engineer on the team, you&#39;ll work on advancing our models&#39; ability to reliably and safely operate real software. We&#39;re looking for someone who&#39;s genuinely excited about both the research and the product sides of computer use.&lt;/p&gt;
