&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing evals or benchmarks for LLMs or vision language models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Large-scale pretraining, SL, and RL on language models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep learning research on images, video, or other modalities&lt;/li&gt;
