&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in cybersecurity, including knowledge of offensive techniques, exploit development, malware analysis, or vulnerability research&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience performing content review, abuse investigations, or policy enforcement at volume&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in SQL and/or Python for data analysis and threat detection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience identifying emerging risks and communicating findings to a diverse set of stakeholders, such as Product, Policy, Engineering, and Legal teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with generative AI products, including writing effective prompts for content review and enforcement&lt;/li&gt;
