&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understanding of the challenges involved in implementing product policies at scale in the content moderation space&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sound judgment in ambiguous, high-consequence cases, and comfort making a call and escalating appropriately when the available signal is incomplete&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
