&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to work across teams (threat intelligence, enforcement, engineering, policy) and communicate clearly in writing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
