&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Passion for AI technology and commitment to its safe, responsible development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Business-level Korean required; English proficiency strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
