&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on Salesforce development experience (Apex, SOQL, LWC, Flow) in a production org&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience building or maintaining partner/channel functionality in Salesforce: deal registration, partner portals, attribution models, or co-sell opportunity management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience integrating Salesforce with external platforms via REST/Bulk APIs, middleware (Workato, Mulesoft, or similar), or direct callouts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fluency with SFDX, source-controlled metadata, and a sandbox-to-prod release process with peer review&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Active use of AI-assisted development tools (Claude, Copilot, Cursor, or similar) as part of how you write and review code, and the ability to speak to how you steer and verify their output&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Basic SQL skills and comfort working alongside a data warehouse&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Effective communication with sales, partnerships, finance, and engineering stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
