&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;11+ years of experience in sales or account management roles, with a proven track record of growing large, complex accounts and exceeding retention and expansion targets&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success as a strategic business advisor to founders and executives, deeply understanding fast-scaling startup needs and creating solutions that align with their vision&lt;/p&gt;
