&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Passion for emerging technologies like AI, with interest in ensuring they are developed safely and responsibly&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience running executive business reviews and managing executive relationships&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Track record of consistently meeting or exceeding quota in fast-paced environments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
