&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rapidly design, prototype, and ship full-stack features across backend, frontend, and infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consult with users and stakeholders to understand workflows and identify the highest-impact opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot patterns across user requests and reduce them into primitives, platforms, or middleware that support a variety of use cases—not just one-off features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build tools that maximize autonomy and creative freedom for less-technical users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make product and prioritization decisions, not just execute on specs handed to you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iterate quickly based on feedback to continuously improve the user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pick up new tools, frameworks, and domains as the product evolves&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
