&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design sensibility or hands-on experience with UI/UX for AI-powered applications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with real-time applications, WebSocket implementations, or complex frontend interactions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
