&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll own positioning, messaging, and go-to-market for healthcare and science launches, features, and campaigns, ensuring cohesive positioning across distinct audiences within the vertical. In your first 90 days, you&#39;ll stand up a new commercial pitch and webinars, support the GA of Claude Science and new product capabilities, and support multiple keynotes. You&#39;ll partner closely with Product and Research, go-to-market and sales teams, Comms, Brand and Design, and Enterprise Marketing across campaigns and content.&lt;/p&gt;
