&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain the distributed systems that serve Claude to millions of users worldwide&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop resilient, flexible systems that adapt in real time to real world events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop intelligent request routing, load balancing, and traffic management systems across thousands of accelerators and multiple cloud providers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maximize compute efficiency and optimize cost across the fleet by autoscaling and orchestrating production, research, and experimental workloads across multiple cloud providers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and operate production-grade deployment pipelines for releasing new models to users&lt;/li&gt;
