&lt;p&gt;As a Strategic Account Executive (Healthcare) at Anthropic, you&#39;ll join the foundational team at the forefront of introducing our frontier AI platform to healthcare organizations. You&#39;ll drive adoption of safe, frontier AI by securing strategic deals with health systems, hospitals, and payor organizations. You&#39;ll leverage your consultative sales expertise in healthcare to grow revenue while becoming a trusted partner to healthcare stakeholders — helping them embed and deploy AI while uncovering its full range of capabilities. In collaboration with Product and Marketing, you&#39;ll continuously refine our value proposition, sales methodology, and market positioning to resonate with healthcare decision-makers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate has a passion for developing new market segments within healthcare delivery and insurance, pinpointing high-potential opportunities, and executing strategies to capture them. By driving deployment of Anthropic&#39;s emerging products, you&#39;ll help healthcare enterprises obtain new capabilities while advancing the ethical development of AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a book of strategic, high-value accounts across health systems, hospitals, and payor organizations — driving the full sales cycle from outbound to close and navigating complex organizations to reach key clinical, administrative, and payor decision-makers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute sales strategies tailored to healthcare procurement cycles, value-based care initiatives, and budgeting processes, translating market landscape and trend analysis into targeted account plans and campaigns that meet and exceed revenue targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and prioritize high-potential opportunities across clinical departments, care management teams, claims processing units, and administrative offices, partnering cross-functionally to differentiate Anthropic&#39;s offering for both healthcare delivery and payor use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run a disciplined pipeline and forecasting cadence, managing an evolving sales process to deliver predictable, coachable performance against quota&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product and Applied AI to translate feedback from clinicians, care coordinators, and administrative leaders into product and roadmap input, strengthening Anthropic&#39;s value proposition for healthcare organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Codify learnings into playbooks, templates, and best practices, partnering with Marketing and Enablement to scale winning use cases and proof points across health systems and payors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of enterprise sales experience in healthcare, with demonstrated success covering health systems, hospitals, and/or payor organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of managing complex, multi-stakeholder sales cycles within healthcare organizations and securing strategic deals by understanding both technical requirements and clinical/administrative use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience negotiating complex agreements within healthcare procurement frameworks, including value-based care contracts and payor policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience exceeding revenue targets in healthcare by effectively managing an evolving pipeline and sales process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the ability to present confidently across healthcare audiences — from physicians and nurses to C-suite executives and payor leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine interest in deploying AI responsibly and motivation to advance Anthropic&#39;s mission of building safe, beneficial AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of healthcare buying cycles, decision-making processes, and key pain points across both provider and payor organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strategic, analytical approach to assessing the healthcare market, paired with creative, tactical execution to capture opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and refining healthcare AI use cases in collaboration with customers and channel partners, with particular focus on care delivery, population health, and administrative efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for and/or experience with advanced AI systems and their clinical applications, with strong conviction around safe, ethical development for AI in clinical use&lt;/li&gt;
