&lt;li&gt;Experience running recruiting or talent operations at global scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of recruiting compliance, like OFCCP, GDPR, and regional employment law, and how it shapes process and systems decisions&lt;/li&gt;
