&lt;p&gt;Working knowledge of FAT/SAT and commissioning workflows and how equipment documentation gates them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Heavy-haul / project logistics experience, including international freight, customs, and Incoterms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technical understanding of data center electrical distribution and cooling system design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with ERP/procurement systems and analytics tools (SQL, Power BI/Tableau, Smartsheet/Procore).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PMP, CSCP, or similar certification.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
