&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are deeply interested in the potential transformative effects of advanced AI systems and agents, and are committed to ensuring their safe deployment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have experience with container or VM orchestration at scale&lt;/p&gt;
