&lt;p&gt;Own full lifecycle recruiting for a portfolio of roles across the Security organization, from intake through offer and close&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Run structured intakes with security hiring managers, translating ambiguous needs into scoped requirements, calibrated bars, and search strategies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and maintain pipelines of specialized security talent, with an emphasis on passive candidates&lt;/p&gt;
